## Project Overview

BiteBox Grill is a fictional fast-food business created for this project.

The website gives customers information about the business, its food,
prices and contact details.

The website is designed to be simple and easy to use.

## Target Audience

The website is mainly for:

- Students
- Families
- Young workers
- Local customers

## Website Goals and Objectives

The main goals of the website are:

- Give BiteBox Grill an online presence.
- Show customers the menu and prices.
- Give information about the business.
- Allow customers to send enquiries.
- Make it easy for customers to find contact details.
- Make the website easy to navigate.

## Key Performance Indicators

The website can be measured by:

- Number of visitors.
- Number of menu page views.
- Number of enquiries.
- Number of contact page visits.
- Number of returning visitors.

## Website Pages

The website has five main pages:

1. Home - index.html
2. About Us - about.html
3. Menu - products.html
4. Enquiry - enquiry.html
5. Contact - contact.html

## Key Features

The website includes:

- Navigation menu.
- Five HTML pages.
- BiteBox Grill logo.
- Food images.
- Menu and prices.
- About Us information.
- Enquiry form.
- Contact information.
- More than one business location.
- Basic CSS styling.

