## Part 2 Testing

### HTML Validation

The HTML pages were tested using the W3C HTML Checker.

The following pages were checked:

- index.html
- about.html
- products.html
- enquiry.html
- contact.html

No HTML errors were found during validation. Warnings were reviewed and did not prevent the website from working correctly.

### Browser and Responsive Testing

The website was tested at different browser window sizes. The pages were checked to make sure that:

- Navigation remains usable.
- Text remains readable.
- Images remain inside their sections.
- Menu cards adjust to smaller screens.
- Forms fit smaller screens.
- Buttons remain usable.
- Content does not extend outside the page.

### Accessibility Testing

Keyboard navigation was tested using the Tab key. Links and buttons could be reached using the keyboard.

Images also include alternative text to describe their content.

